   "module_16121289240844": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "10px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<ul></ul>\n<p><strong>What happens when you actually do this:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Revenue streams you don't have right now.</li>\n<li>Your customers already trust you\u2014give them a supplement with your name on it and watch loyalty tighten.</li>\n<li>Brand awareness compounds when you own the entire customer experience, from discovery through delivery. Plus, you're not gambling on quality; <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> <span style=\"background:#F8DDD9;border-bottom:2px solid #9B3B31;\" data-praxera-review=\"claim\">handles the formulation</span>, sourcing, and compliance so you don't have to.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The barrier to entry used to be high. Not anymore.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The people actually doing this? They don't see it as optional. They see it as the best move. Because once you realize how straightforward private label is with <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>, everything else,&nbsp;reselling commodity products, waiting for the next trend ... suddenly feels like settling.<br><br>Click the button below to view the article, <span style=\"color: #6ca439;\"><a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/blog/benefits-of-selling-private-label-supplements\" style=\"color: #6ca439;\" rel=\"noopener\">Six Benefits of Selling Private Label</a></span> Supplements.<span style=\"color: #6ca439;\">:</span></p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
    "child_css": {},
    "css": {},
    "id": "module_16121289240844",
    "label": null,
    "module_id": 1155639,
    "name": "module_16121289240844",
    "order": 7,
    "smart_type": null,
    "styles": {},
    "type": "module"
   },
   "module_16123736011481": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "10px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<p>Hi&nbsp;{{ contact.firstname }},</p>\n<p>You've probably seen our Private Label Guide. If so, you know the potential. Your own branded supplement line, real margins, real differentiation, real control over what hits your customers' shelves.<br><br></p>\n<p>Here's the thing: private label isn't about reinventing the wheel. It's about slapping your name on something already proven to work. You're outsourcing manufacturing to a partner like <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> while keeping everything that matters\u2014your brand, your customer relationship, your margins.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The math is simple. A custom formulation from scratch? Years of development, regulatory nightmares, six-figure minimums. Private label? You're talking $500 to start. One or two products. Test the market. See what actually sells before you commit.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
    "child_css": {},
    "css": {},
