     },
     "html": "<p>P.S. Still have questions? Let's talk. \u2192&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #6ca439;\"><a href=\"https://meetings.hubspot.com/samantha-fuller/private-label-round-robin\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #6ca439;\" rel=\"noopener\" data-hs-link-id=\"1\" data-hs-link-id-v2=\"ugEAimlq\">Schedule a quick call with our private label team</a></span></p>",
